## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Environment files (school rule: real .env is secret, template is committed)
**/.env
!**/.env.example

# Local dev settings hold the localhost connection string — never commit them.
# Real secrets live in AWS Secrets Manager (cloud) or the gitignored .env (local).
**/appsettings.Development.json

# Cloud credentials / keys / IaC state — NEVER commit (Failsafe rule = grade 0).
*.pem
*.key
.aws/
**/*credentials*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# SQL backups (clutter, not part of the schema)
database/*_bak.sql

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml
InventoryAPI/appsettings.Development.json
API_DOCUMENTATION.md
API_ENDPOINTS.md
CRUD_API_DOCUMENTATION.md
hus.md